        "abstract": "This article presents a series of recommendations to integrate techniques of Security Engineering with Agile Methods without compromising agility. Such recommendations are grouped in a guide based on a literature review. To evaluate the guide, specialists with different profiles were interviewed in order to obtain a variety of perspectives on the addressed subject. This way, positive and negative aspects of guide were obtained as a result of a qualitative research.",
