        ],
        "abstract": "This article does a scanning of the Scrum agile method checking its adherence to the level G of the quality model proposed by MPS.BR. It was observed that it does not fully meet the expected results of this level. Thus, the objective of this work is to propose an adaptation of the Scrum, able to meet the requirements of the level G with basis on the experience of the implementers, evaluators and the companies evaluated in the model. This research came to a set of practices and techniques which presents satisfaction evidence of the expected requirements of the initial level of quality model proposed by MPS.BR.",
